  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵许多开发者抱怨移动应用程序开发比网页应用程序开发更困难。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教程与疑难排解",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "他们尝试精确地遵循在线教程，但移动应用程序仍然无法运作。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教程与疑难排解",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这是因为移动平台发展迅速，教程无法保持最新。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教程与疑难排解",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我的朋友遇到了上述情况，无法从位置管理器获得任何位置更新。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教程与疑难排解",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "他将 CoreLocation.framework 库加入到 Link Binary，",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教程与疑难排解",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然后，他放入以下代码，看起来是对的。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教程与疑难排解",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "{% gist 18ab0cc09e57cc2a4e6b AppDelegate.swift %}",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教程与疑难排解",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，控制台没有任何输出。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教程与疑难排解",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这是因为从 iOS 8 开始，你需要加入 NSLocationAlwaysUsageDescription 或 NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription，取决于 requestAlwaysAuthorization（用于后台位置）或 requestWhenInUseAuthorization（仅在前台时的位置）。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教程与疑难排解",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "让我们开始构建并运行应用程序。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教程与疑难排解",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你第一次启动它，你应该会看到以下警告。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教程与疑难排解",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "点击允许后，你应该会获得更新。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教程与疑难排解",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你在模拟器上运行，你可能需要通过从 Debug -> Location 选择位置来调整位置。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教程与疑难排解",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
